flow Root():
	# Freedom with Friends — 1.0-safe flags for airport / phone
	# Shared-owner multiplayer (Nook Stop, mailbox, houses-as-visitor) needs exefs
	# patches — see docs/SHARED_OWNER.md and exefs/*.pchtxt.disabled

